                    <Value>* NOTE: All waivers must be for the full amount paid. If waiver is for a corporation, corporate name should be used, corporate seal affixed and title of officer signing waiver should be set forth; if waiver is for a partnership, the partnership name should be used, partner should sign and designate himself as partner. Failure of contractor to make the payment to undersigned as "acknowledged" herein shall render any waiver of rights herein by undersigned null and void. Extras include, but are not limited to change orders, both oral and written, to the contract.</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                      <FontSize>8pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                      <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                      <Color>#000000</Color>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <Style />
